Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.6.0)
Description: transitional package, replaced by secubox-core
 The board identity defaults (/etc/default/secubox) are now shipped by
 secubox-core. This empty package only pulls it in; it can be removed once
 nothing depends on it.
